    "text": "Friction is absent everywhere and the threads, spring and pulleys are massless. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi></math>, then the angular frequency of the system for small oscillations will be<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0629487.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 165px;\" />",
